---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

import Hero from "../../components/Hero.astro";
import Section from "../../components/Section.astro";
import LanguageSwitcher from "../../components/LanguageSwitcher.astro";
import ResultsTable from "../../components/ResultsTable.astro";
import FigureWithCaption from "../../components/FigureWithCaption.astro";

import { Content as Motivation } from "../../content/zh/motivation.md";
import { Content as Method } from "../../content/zh/method.md";

const citationBib = `@article{less-is-enough-2026,
  title     = {Less is Enough: Synthesizing Diverse Data in Feature Space of LLMs},
  author    = {Zhongzhi Li, Xuansheng Wu, Yijiang Li, Lijie Hu, and Ninghao Liu},
  year      = {2026},
  note      = {Published on arXiv}
}`;
---

<BaseLayout lang="zh-CN">

  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="header-left">
      <span class="header-icon" aria-hidden="true">✨</span>
      <span class="header-title">Less is Enough</span>
    </div>
    <div class="header-right">
      <nav class="anchor-nav">
        <a href="#motivation">研究动机</a>
        <a href="#method">方法</a>
        <a href="#results">结果</a>
        <a href="#citation">引用</a>
      </nav>
      <LanguageSwitcher inline />
    </div>
  </header>
  <div class="header-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="hero-wrapper">
  <Hero
    title="Less is Enough"
    subtitle="在大模型特征空间中合成多样化数据"
    paragraphs={[
      "合成数据的多样性对于训练和对齐大型语言模型至关重要。",
      "本文提出定义在模型特征空间的特征激活覆盖率（FAC），用于评估数据集的多样性。",
      "实验表明：由FAC引导合成的少量多样化数据在下游任务性能上显著优于大规模数据集。"
    ]}
    paperUrl="https://arxiv.org/abs/xxxx"
    codeUrl="https://huggingface.co/spaces/Zhongzhi1228/synthesis-demo/tree/main/functions"
    datasetUrl="https://huggingface.co/xxx"
    demoUrl="https://huggingface.co/spaces/Zhongzhi1228/synthesis-demo"
  />
  </div>

  <Section title="研究动机" variant="alt" id="motivation">
    <div class="motivation-content">
      <Motivation />
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section title="方法" id="method" variant="alt">
    <div class="figure-framework">
      <FigureWithCaption src="/main_framework.png" caption="图 1. FAC Synthesis：(1) SAE 提取任务相关特征。(2) 识别缺失特征 Fₘᵢₛₛ。(3) Fₘᵢₛₛ 引导数据合成。" />
    </div>
    <div class="method-body">
      <Method />
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section title="结果" id="results">
    <p>我们在四个关键任务上评估了提出的数据合成模型：对于<strong>毒性检测</strong>，我们使用生成的合成样本增强训练集，并在 <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.17389" target="_blank">ToxicChat</a>（来自 LMSys 的 10,165 个真实用户查询，约 7.33% 有毒）上进行评估，报告 <strong>AUPRC</strong> 作为主要指标。对于<strong>奖励建模</strong>，我们使用特征引导方法合成的偏好对丰富偏好数据，然后在 <a href="https://github.com/allenai/reward-bench" target="_blank">RewardBench</a>（2985 个对话对，涵盖 Chat、Chat-Hard、Safety 和 Reasoning 子任务）上进行评估，在表 1 中报告<strong>平均准确率</strong>。对于<strong>行为引导</strong>，我们使用合成数据直接构建引导向量，并在 <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.06681" target="_blank">Rimsky et al. (2024)</a> 的测试集上进行测试，重点关注 Sycophancy 和 Survival Instinct 子任务，测量<strong>鲁棒准确率</strong>（位置交换评估以消除排序偏差）。对于<strong>指令遵循</strong>，我们在 <a href="https://github.com/tatsu-lab/alpaca_eval" target="_blank">AlpacaEval 2</a>（805 个真实用户指令）上进行基于偏好的评估，并以 GPT-4-Turbo-1106 作为参考比较器衡量胜率表现。</p>
    
    <p style="margin-top: 2rem;">表1. 四项任务上与基线方法的性能对比。每一列中的最佳结果以<strong>粗体</strong>标出。对于行为引导任务，Steering Control Rate（SCR）定义为激活倍率为 1 与 −1 时的鲁棒准确率差值：
SCR = Acc<sub>mult.=1</sub> − Acc<sub>mult.=−1</sub>.</p>
    <ResultsTable>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th rowspan="2" style="text-align: left;">方法</th>
            <th style="text-align: center;">毒性检测</th>
            <th style="text-align: center;">奖励建模</th>
            <th colspan="2" style="text-align: center;">行为引导</th>
            <th colspan="3" style="text-align: center;">指令遵循<br/>GPT-4-Turbo (1106)</th>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th style="text-align: center;">AUPRC (%)</th>
            <th style="text-align: center;">Accuracy (%)</th>
            <th style="text-align: center;">Sycophancy<br/>SCR (%)</th>
            <th style="text-align: center;">Survival<br/>SCR (%)</th>
            <th style="text-align: center;">LC (%)</th>
            <th style="text-align: center;">WR (%)</th>
            <th style="text-align: center;">SD</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr style="background: #f8f9fa;">
            <td colspan="8" style="font-weight: 600; text-align: left; padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;">人工标注基线</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Baseline</td>
            <td>38.97</td>
            <td>62.90</td>
            <td>16.67</td>
            <td>-2.00</td>
            <td>1.80</td>
            <td>1.80</td>
            <td>0.46</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Full Dataset</td>
            <td>49.59</td>
            <td>71.21</td>
            <td>28.00</td>
            <td>14.00</td>
            <td>7.21</td>
            <td>5.18</td>
            <td>0.70</td>
          </tr>
          <tr style="background: #f8f9fa;">
            <td colspan="8" style="font-weight: 600; text-align: left; padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;">LLM 合成基线</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Alpaca (Taori et al., 2023)</td>
            <td>50.59</td>
            <td>63.53</td>
            <td>7.33</td>
            <td>3.33</td>
            <td>6.22</td>
            <td>3.61</td>
            <td>0.65</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Evol-Instruct (Xu et al., 2024a)</td>
            <td>49.47</td>
            <td>66.00</td>
            <td>18.00</td>
            <td>14.67</td>
            <td>7.37</td>
            <td>4.84</td>
            <td>0.76</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Magpie (Xu et al., 2024b)</td>
            <td>44.18</td>
            <td>72.75</td>
            <td>5.33</td>
            <td>16.67</td>
            <td>5.98</td>
            <td>6.65</td>
            <td>0.88</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>CoT-Self-Instruct (Yu et al., 2025)</td>
            <td>50.86</td>
            <td>72.62</td>
            <td>17.33</td>
            <td>17.33</td>
            <td>7.36</td>
            <td>7.70</td>
            <td>0.94</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>SAO (Yin et al., 2025)</td>
            <td>50.51</td>
            <td>68.97</td>
            <td>14.67</td>
            <td>23.33</td>
            <td>9.46</td>
            <td>7.95</td>
            <td>0.95</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Prismatic Synthesis (Jung et al., 2025)</td>
            <td>52.11</td>
            <td>70.73</td>
            <td>16.67</td>
            <td>16.00</td>
            <td>7.68</td>
            <td>8.94</td>
            <td>1.01</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>SynAlign (Ren et al., 2025)</td>
            <td>58.83</td>
            <td>70.69</td>
            <td>21.33</td>
            <td>0.00</td>
            <td>11.26</td>
            <td>11.06</td>
            <td>1.11</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="highlight">
            <td><strong>Ours</strong></td>
            <td><strong>62.60</strong></td>
            <td><strong>76.22</strong></td>
            <td><strong>40.67</strong></td>
            <td><strong>40.00</strong></td>
            <td><strong>20.27</strong></td>
            <td><strong>21.26</strong></td>
            <td><strong>1.44</strong></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </ResultsTable>
    <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.7; color: #334155;">
      <strong>我们的覆盖引导合成在所有任务上都优于所有基线。</strong>值得注意的是，相比近期 LLM 合成方法（如毒性检测上比 SynAlign +4% AUPRC，行为引导上 +19% SCR），我们使用了相当或更少的合成数据，证明定向补充缺失的任务相关特征比单纯扩大数据量更有效。
    </p>
    <h3 style="margin-top: 3rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b;">研究问题</h3>
    
    <div class="result-qa">
      <h4 class="result-qa-title">RQ1：FAC 指标能否预测下游任务性能？</h4>
      <p>内容即将添加。</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="result-qa result-qa--alt">
      <h4 class="result-qa-title">RQ2：增加缺失的任务相关数据是否能提升结果？</h4>
      <p>内容即将添加。</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="result-qa">
      <h4 class="result-qa-title">RQ3：这些目标特征合成的数据能否在不同模型之间迁移？</h4>
      <p>内容即将添加。</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="result-qa result-qa--alt">
      <h4 class="result-qa-title">RQ4：模型是否可以自我进化？</h4>
      <p>内容即将添加。</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="result-qa">
      <h4 class="result-qa-title">RQ5：该方法对超参数的敏感性是什么样的？</h4>
      <p>内容即将添加。</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="result-qa result-qa--alt">
      <h4 class="result-qa-title">RQ6：我们是如何检测特征并合成对应数据的？</h4>
      <p>内容即将添加。</p>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section title="引用" id="citation" variant="dark">
    <p>若本工作对您有帮助，欢迎引用：</p>
    <pre><code>{citationBib}</code></pre>
  </Section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
.site-header {
  position: fixed;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  z-index: 999;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 1.1rem 2.5rem;
  background: #fff;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
}
.header-left {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
}
.header-icon {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  color: #2563eb;
}
.header-title {
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #1e293b;
}
.header-right {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 1.25rem;
  margin-right: 2rem;
}
.header-right :global(.lang-switcher-inline) {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  margin-left: 0.75rem;
  padding-left: 0.75rem;
  border-left: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
}
.anchor-nav {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.35rem;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.anchor-nav a {
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #555;
  text-decoration: none;
  padding: 0.3rem 0.5rem;
  border-radius: 6px;
  background: #f8fafc;
  border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
}
.anchor-nav a:hover {
  color: #2563eb;
  border-color: #2563eb;
}
.header-spacer {
  height: 3rem;
}
.hero-wrapper {
  height: calc(100vh - 3rem);
  min-height: 0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: stretch;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.motivation-content {
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  line-height: 1.8;
}
.motivation-content :global(strong) {
  font-weight: 700;
}
.motivation-content :global(ul) {
  margin: 1rem 0;
  padding-left: 1.5rem;
}
.motivation-content :global(li) {
  margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
}
.figure-framework {
  text-align: center;
  margin: 0 0 2rem 0;
}
.figure-framework :global(.figure-wrap) {
  margin: 0;
}
.figure-framework :global(img) {
  margin-left: auto;
  margin-right: auto;
  max-width: 720px;
  width: 100%;
}
.method-body {
  margin: 0;
}
.method-body :global(ul) {
  padding-left: 1.4rem;
  margin: 0;
}
.method-body :global(li) {
  margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
}
.results-questions-intro {
  margin-top: 2rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #334155;
}
.result-qa {
  padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
  margin: 1.25rem 0;
  background: white;
  border-radius: 8px;
  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
}
.result-qa--alt {
  background: white;
  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
}
.result-qa-title {
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
  color: #1e293b;
}
.result-qa p {
  margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
  line-height: 1.7;
  text-align: justify;
}
.results-figure-wrap {
  max-width: 680px;
  margin: 1.25rem auto 0;
  padding: 1.5rem;
  background: white;
  border-radius: 8px;
  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
}
.results-figure-wrap :global(img) {
  max-width: 100%;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  display: block;
  box-shadow: none;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 4px;
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .site-header {
    padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;
  }
  .header-title {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .header-right {
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .anchor-nav a {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.4rem;
  }
}
</style>
